I hate to break the news, but no monster can be generated with random
objects. Only on the Astral Planes are player monsters an exception.
That is the main reason pacifist, i.e. going without death drops, is
so unpopular when going for >=3D8 conducts.

Magic resistance items can very rarely be generated on live monsters:
cloaks of magic resistance on temple priests, Magicbane on arch-
liches, and the quest artifact of some roles. Gray dragons do not have
dragon scales when alive, only when dead.

